  "title": "LPA Announces Reporting Dates for Full-Year 2025 Financial Results",
  "summary": "SAN JOSE, Costa Rica–(BUSINESS WIRE)– Logistic Properties of the Americas (NYSE American: LPA) (“LPA” or the “Company”), a leading developer, owner and manager of institutional quality, Class A industrial and logistics real estate in Central and South America, announced today the reporting dates for its Full-Year 2025 financial results. Earnings Release Wednesday, March 18, 2026 […]",
